# Structural Sizing & Stiffness Optimization (Experiment KTmfk)

This module implements a numerical optimization framework in MATLAB using Sequential Quadratic Programming (`fmincon` with the `'sqp'` algorithm). The goal is to minimize vertical deflection at the loaded node of a 2D truss structure by optimizing bar cross-sectional areas under bound, mass/stiffness, and stress constraints.

